                "title": "Cookies",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "You can configure your browser to refuse some or all cookies or alert you when websites set or access cookies. Disabling cookies may cause parts of this website to become inaccessible or function incorrectly."
