                "title": "Change of purpose",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "We use personal data for the purpose for which it was collected unless another use is reasonably compatible with that purpose. You may contact us for an explanation. If we need to use information for an unrelated purpose, we will notify you and explain the legal basis. We may process information without your knowledge or consent where the law requires or permits it."
