                "width": "reading",
                "spacing": "compact"
              },
              "data": {
                "title": "How long we retain data",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "We retain personal data only for as long as necessary for the purpose for which it was collected, including legal, accounting and reporting requirements. The retention period reflects the amount, nature and sensitivity of the data, the risk of harm from unauthorised use or disclosure, the processing purpose, whether that purpose can be achieved by other means and applicable legal requirements."
                  },
