              "data": {
                "title": "Browser storage & analytics",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "The planner remembers travel preferences in this browser tab for up to 24 hours. Name, email, phone and free-text notes are not included in that saved draft."
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "We also keep a random submission reference in the tab to avoid duplicate enquiries when you retry. Closing the tab clears this session storage."
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "paragraph",
                    "text": "When website measurement is enabled, we record page paths and enquiry steps using a temporary session identifier. These events exclude form contents, URL query strings and IP addresses. Measurement respects your browser’s Do Not Track setting."
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
